<section class="case__body">
  <h2>The <em>award.</em></h2>
  <div class="case__body__copy">
    <p>In December 2019, Apple awarded Lifecake <strong>"Best of 2019"</strong> in the category <em>"The Storyteller Within"</em> — selected from thousands of App Store submissions. As the only web designer on a five-person team, this remains my most memorable career win.</p>
    <p>Lifecake was featured worldwide on the App Store. The recognition validated the bet on stories over storage — the redesign made the product about <em>parents and their kids</em>, not about file management.</p>
  </div>
</section>

